      "properties": {
        "Node name for S/R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Read across the five steps, then press Queue Prompt.\n\n1. Who she is. Down is the front. Left is the side. Up is the back.\n2. The pose. This depth matches the left facing.\n3. Words. Click Use these words. The crown braid is hair, not a circlet.\n4. Knobs. Strength 1, steps 28, guidance 4. Leave the seed fixed.\n5. Decide. Approve or Deny writes the book and does not redraw.\n   Save knobs stores this page in the game repo.\n\nThe gray row is wiring. Leave those nodes collapsed.\nPose depth stays on the side depth. The other cells are in that\nsame list: wdb-depth-down.png and one file per facing.\nWalk: Review the walk clips, mark Good or Bad, Build the walk test,\nthen Queue the walk folder. Set Her picture to that same facing.\nWhole-bible shading is the other page: WDB Style lock."
      ],
      "color": "#8ec8f8",
      "bgcolor": "#1c3d5c",
      "title": "Start here"
    },
