      "widgets_values": [
        "refcontrol. 2D pixel-art sprite. Flat #FF00FF. No new shadows. Crisp flat colors, hard edges.\n\nSquare front view copied from the reference. Eyes, nose, chest, and belt face the camera. Toes point at the viewer. Both shoulders the same width. Both ears visible.\n\nFemale player character copied from the reference. Long dark wavy hair hangs loose from the scalp down the back in one sheet, same hang as the reference. A small braid lies along the crown of the scalp only. That is hair on the top of the head, not a worn circlet. Hair is not tied. Ends hang free. Burgundy fitted armor, dark trousers, brown boots. A short green neckband worn only around the neck, same bulk as the reference. Hands empty. No weapon. No tool."
      ],
      "color": "#d8e89a",
      "bgcolor": "#3c4818",
      "title": "3. What to keep"
    },
